      "type": "form",
      "kind": "zoller_serial",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-inner\"> <a id=\"c97321\"></a> <div class=\"update-download\"> <div class=\"steps step1\"> <div class=\"step1\"><span>Machine</span></div> <div class=\"step2\"><span>Version</span></div> <div class=\"step3\"><span>Download</span></div> <div class=\"step4\"><span>Installation</span></div> </div> <h3 class=\"h3\"> Always updated – with the latest version of the ZOLLER software </h3> <p> Benefit from the latest software features! </p> <div class=\"serialForm\"> <div class=\"row\"> <form action=\"https://www.zoller.info/ch/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0?tx_zoller_serial%5Baction%5D=query&amp;tx_zoller_serial%5Bcontroller%5D=Serial&amp;cHash=43bf47983b7affb35cf8fbcaa23caed3\" class=\"query-form\" data-loadingtext=\"The machine number is being checked ...\" method=\"post\"> <div> <input name=\"tx_zoller_serial[__referrer][@extension]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Zoller\"/> <input name=\"tx_zoller_serial[__referrer][@controller]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Serial\"/> <input name=\"tx_zoller_serial[__referrer][@action]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"form\"/> <input name=\"tx_zoller_serial[__referrer][arguments]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"YTowOnt965e1b12576fe0a1c8a3e6c2e5feb3d694d086872\"/> <input name=\"tx_zoller_serial[__referrer][@request]\" type=\"hidden\" value='{\"@extension\":\"Zoller\",\"@controller\":\"Serial\",\"@action\":\"form\"}ad3c069bd9c599176a9bcfb5ab087e29f8f2fc61'/> <input name=\"tx_zoller_serial[__trustedProperties]\" type=\"hidden\" value='{\"serial\":1}887e8cc9567a598e154eb5435aea80760c6193fe'/> </div> <div class=\"input\"> <label for=\"input_serial\">Machine/serial number</label> <input id=\"input_serial\" name=\"tx_zoller_serial[serial]\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\"/> </div> <button class=\"block-button\" name=\"\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Send\"><span>Send</span></button> </form> </div> </div> <p> Are you running an older main version, but would like to benefit from the <b>extended functional scope</b> of the latest version? If so, please contact <a class=\"arrow-link\" href=\"mailto:service@zoller-d.com\">service@zoller-d.com</a> for presetting, measuring and inspection devices and <a class=\"arrow-link\" href=\"mailto:TMS-Support@zoller-d.com\">TMS-Support@zoller-d.com</a> for the TMS Tool Management Solutions. </p> <p><b>Note:</b> <br/>The machine or software serial number is written on the identification plate or within the software under</p> <ul class=\"notice-list\"> <li>»pilot 3.0/4.0«: Menü &gt; \"about »pilot 3.0« respectivly »pilot 4.0«\"</li> <li>»pilot 2 mT«: \"enhanced features (Icon with three bullets) &gt; informationen (i-Button)\"</li> </ul> <p> The update can only be installed on this specific machine. The latest patch of the respective software version is provided, an update to a higher major version is not possible via this website. </p> <div class=\"loading\"> <div class=\"loader\"> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\"> <g transform=\"translate(50,50)\"> <circle fill=\"none\" r=\"8.333333333333334\" stroke=\"#D7C928\" stroke-dasharray=\"26.179938779914945 26.179938779914945\" stroke-width=\"4\"> <animatetransform attributename=\"transform\" begin=\"0\" calcmode=\"spline\" dur=\"1.1s\" keysplines=\"0.2 0 0.6 0.9\" repeatcount=\"indefinite\" type=\"rotate\" values=\"0 0 0;360 0 0\"></animatetransform> </circle> <circle fill=\"none\" r=\"16.666666666666668\" stroke=\"#CCCCCC\" stroke-dasharray=\"52.35987755982989 52.35987755982989\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <animatetransform attributename=\"transform\" begin=\"-0.6\" calcmode=\"spline\" dur=\"1.3s\" keysplines=\"0.2 0 0.6 0.9\" repeatcount=\"indefinite\" type=\"rotate\" values=\"0 0 0;360 0 0\"></animatetransform> </circle> <circle fill=\"none\" r=\"25\" stroke=\"#F0E600\" stroke-dasharray=\"78.53981633974483 78.53981633974483\" stroke-width=\"6\"> <animatetransform attributename=\"transform\" begin=\"-0.2\" calcmode=\"spline\" dur=\"1.2s\" keysplines=\"0.2 0 0.6 0.9\" repeatcount=\"indefinite\" type=\"rotate\" values=\"0 0 0;360 0 0\"></animatetransform> </circle> <circle fill=\"none\" r=\"33.333333333333336\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-dasharray=\"104.71975511965978 104.71975511965978\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <animatetransform attributename=\"transform\" begin=\"-0.8\" calcmode=\"spline\" dur=\"1.3s\" keysplines=\"0.2 0 0.6 0.9\" repeatcount=\"indefinite\" type=\"rotate\" values=\"0 0 0;360 0 0\"></animatetransform> </circle> <circle fill=\"none\" r=\"41.666666666666664\" stroke=\"#FFFF99\" stroke-dasharray=\"130.89969389957471 130.89969389957471\" stroke-width=\"4\"> <animatetransform attributename=\"transform\" begin=\"-0.1\" calcmode=\"spline\" dur=\"1s\" keysplines=\"0.2 0 0.6 0.9\" repeatcount=\"indefinite\" type=\"rotate\" values=\"0 0 0;360 0 0\"></animatetransform> </circle> </g> </svg> </div> <div class=\"loadingtext\"></div> </div> </div> </div>",
